{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14909","headline":"寄赠库部王郎中 · 卢纶","name":"寄赠库部王郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谔谔汉名臣，从天令若春。\n叙辞皆诏旨，称宦即星辰。\n草木承风偃，云雷施泽均。\n威惩治粟尉，恩洽让田人。\n泉货方将散，京坻自此陈。\n五营俱益竈，千里不停轮。\n未远金门籍，旋清玉塞尘。\n硕儒推庆重，良友颂公频。\n鹤发逢新镜，龙门跃旧鳞。\n荷君偏有问，深感浩难申。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}